15 0 obj
<< /A 42 0 R /Alt (Flowchart diagram of a YOLOv8-based deep learning architecture for skin lesion detection, showing modules for feature extraction, feature pyramid networks, context-aware multiscale fusion, boundary-aware detection heads, and loss functions, with arrows indicating data flow between layers and branches.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 30 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
16 0 obj
<< /A 43 0 R /Alt (Collage of twenty-four close-up photographs of skin lesions, each labeled with a blue rectangle and annotated with \215skin_disease\216 and an associated probability value ranging from zero point four to one point zero, illustrating automated detection of dermatological abnormalities.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 35 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
17 0 obj
<< /A 44 0 R /Alt (Grid of twenty-four close-up skin lesion images, each marked by a blue bounding box with \215skin_disease\216 labels. Some labels include confidence scores ranging from 0.6 to 0.9. Images vary in lesion color, pattern, and size.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 36 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
18 0 obj
<< /A 45 0 R /Alt (Twenty-four dermatological images arranged in a grid, each showing areas of skin with visible lesions, moles, or discoloration. Blue rectangles labeled \215skin_disease\216 or \215skin_disease\216 plus a confidence score enclose affected regions for diagnostic identification.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 37 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
19 0 obj
<< /A 46 0 R /Alt (Normalized confusion matrix heatmap showing classification of \215skin_disease\216 and \215background\216 with predicted versus true labels. Matrix indicates high classification accuracy: 0.99 for skin_disease, 1.00 for background, and 0.01 false positives for background.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 38 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
20 0 obj
<< /A 47 0 R /Alt (Two vertically stacked line charts show model evaluation. The top precision-recall curve plots precision versus recall for skin disease detection, achieving 0.992 mAP@0.5. The lower F1-confidence curve plots F1 score versus confidence, with a maximum F1 of 0.98 at 0.411 confidence level for all classes. Both curves compare results for a single class and all classes, marked with blue lines.) /K 1 /P 8 0 R /Pg 38 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
